{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A puzzle novel game where you collect memory cores hidden on the island to uncover\u00a0the mystery behind what happened there.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25a0 Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An island abandoned by its people, where even buildings have decayed into heaps of junk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You awaken in this quiet, desolate place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With no memories of your own, you follow the guidance of a great tree to collect memory cores\u2014fragments of memories left behind by the island\u2019s former inhabitants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759130/extras/a9eef400aadcabeadd255ce4d6e8161f.avif?t=1753714848\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25a0 How to Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game consists of two main parts:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The <strong>Puzzle Part</strong>, where you collect memory cores, and the <strong>Novel Part</strong>, where you relive events through the memories of the characters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Satisfying puzzles where chain reactions blast away blocks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hit blocks of the same color with a matching colored shot when two or more are connected to trigger a chain explosion and clear them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Break through the obstacles and reach the main core at the end of the stage to clear it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Since the number of shots is limited, plan your moves carefully to trigger efficient chain reactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759130/extras/10ac32e0dba280c09e506bf015d2e8c1.poster.avif?t=1753714848\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759130/extras/10ac32e0dba280c09e506bf015d2e8c1.webm?t=1753714848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759130/extras/10ac32e0dba280c09e506bf015d2e8c1.mp4?t=1753714848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Relive the island\u2019s story through the memory cores</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Offer the collected cores to the great tree to experience the memories of the island\u2019s people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Items you find during puzzles may unlock new memories as well\u2026</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3759130?t=1753714848","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3759130?t=1753714848","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759130/2ee1e25aa97fbceea730b7a27f90fbd27d061b4c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753714848","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759130/2ee1e25aa97fbceea730b7a27f90fbd27d061b4c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753714848","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A puzzle novel game where you collect memory cores hidden on the island to uncover\u00a0the mystery behind what happened there.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25a0 Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An island abandoned by its people, where even buildings have decayed into heaps of junk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You awaken in this quiet, desolate place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With no memories of your own, you follow the guidance of a great tree to collect memory cores\u2014fragments of memories left behind by the island\u2019s former inhabitants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759130/extras/a9eef400aadcabeadd255ce4d6e8161f.avif?t=1753714848\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25a0 How to Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game consists of two main parts:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The <strong>Puzzle Part</strong>, where you collect memory cores, and the <strong>Novel Part</strong>, where you relive events through the memories of the characters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Satisfying puzzles where chain reactions blast away blocks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hit blocks of the same color with a matching colored shot when two or more are connected to trigger a chain explosion and clear them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Break through the obstacles and reach the main core at the end of the stage to clear it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Since the number of shots is limited, plan your moves carefully to trigger efficient chain reactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759130/extras/10ac32e0dba280c09e506bf015d2e8c1.poster.avif?t=1753714848\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759130/extras/10ac32e0dba280c09e506bf015d2e8c1.webm?t=1753714848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759130/extras/10ac32e0dba280c09e506bf015d2e8c1.mp4?t=1753714848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Relive the island\u2019s story through the memory cores</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Offer the collected cores to the great tree to experience the memories of the island\u2019s people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Items you find during puzzles may unl